# OpenGL ES

Baseline goals:

 * General implementation
 * Outer MLE layer implementation that is similar to ScritchUI so that
   JVM calls are simplified and platform-agnostic.
 * Support both `float` and `fixed`, even if the native platform implementation
   only supports one.
   * Flags will be checked for support, then if not supported a conversion
     will be performed followed by the appropriate forwarded function call
     along with any mapped return value.

